# Where the account's logins and keys are kept, relative to its home: one glob a line (* within a folder's name only,
# no braces). The security watcher watches each file that matches (CREDENTIALS, amethystora-audit-home-rules, with each
# agent profile's logins from /usr/share/amethystora/agent-paths added), and an agent's sandbox hides each one
# (amethystora-agent-tools, sandbox.rs). A login added here is in both the same day.
